,"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Stacked research-only change\nSuccessor to #3038 at exact P20 SHA `463f2d69ce8c4250992e729fba9956985ff8265d`. One atomic three-file commit `53cbc9beace71a1da8f904eea041357b5b82aaa6`, no ancestor/main modifications. This closes a concrete **pre-step** gap: PyTorch SGD allows NaN/Inf learning rates, and stale momentum/Adam state or hook-mutated hyperparameters could poison a nominally finite distillation step.\n\n## Change and negative regressions\n- Restrict this offline research function to built-in SGD/AdamW; reject nonfinite/out-of-budget hyperparameters and unsupported modes.\n- Reject nonfinite/malformed optimizer momentum/Adam state, unknown state, or foreign parameter state.\n- Bind non-parameter optimizer configuration before projection; recheck after backward and before step.\n- CPU tests: SGD NaN/Inf and AdamW Inf, nonfinite momentum, finite but changed rate in a projector hook, custom optimizer `step()`.\n\n## Qualification and limitations\n**DRAFT / SHADOW_ONLY / DENY_ALL / HOLD_NO_GO**. Must obtain exact-head complete Stem shadow checks, architecture, full blocking-ci/cargo-deny/platform Bazel and V8. No claim of completion from queued/cancelled/skipped/old-head outcomes. No atomic rollback from optimizer.step exceptions, real licensed teacher checkpoint execution, 150M/300M trained Student, independent heldout/OOD, 1–4096 Cell GPU/latency/energy or production admission. Architecture remains frozen 421M cognitive control + EmbeddingGemma 2 multimodal perception/Memory Stem + T5Gemma 2 Encoder comparator + native Hepta latent Students + Cell-local lightweight Gate/Adapter/Task-Action-Value Heads/Local State/external Memory.\n\nDetails: `docs/learning/STEM_BAKEOFF_P21_OPTIMIZER_PRESTEP_SAFETY.md`.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-21T11:29:21Z","updated_at":"2026-1